{"date":"2011-01-30","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/b4/40/40126_83pY8.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/b4/40/40126_83pY8.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/b4/40/40126_83pY8.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/b4/40/40126_83pY8.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/b4/40/40126_83pY8.jpg"},"summary":"在一个平静的小镇，矗立在街区中心的小旅馆，头戴礼帽的男子正坐阳台上阅读，他被书籍围在中央，如此自如。突然，晴朗的天空为滚滚乌云遮蔽，飓风来袭，狂风大作，房屋窗棂剧烈晃动，连书上的文字也随风飘散。人与牲畜、家具房屋相继被卷入空中，男子虽然仅仅勾住阳台的栏杆，可是还是随同旅馆一同飞向空中。不久，他们落在了一片荒芜而又有些奇怪的地方。青年四处游荡，寻找可以憩息的场所。这时，他看到一幢美丽的房屋，里面全部为书籍所充满。爱书的男子欣喜过望，他投入到这书的海洋，乐而忘返……\r\n　　本片荣获2012年奥斯卡金像奖最佳动画短片奖。 ","name":"The Fantastic Flying Books of Mr. Morris Lessmore","name_cn":"神奇飞书","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":47,"total_count":102536},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":22,"total_count":1863},{"name":"欧美","count":22,"total_count":86926},{"name":"2011","count":15,"total_count":53113},{"name":"3D","count":12,"total_count":51177},{"name":"治愈","count":9,"total_count":302496},{"name":"动画短片","count":7,"total_count":2075},{"name":"美国","count":6,"total_count":27171},{"name":"原创","count":4,"total_count":621947},{"name":"文艺","count":4,"total_count":3095},{"name":"2010s","count":4,"total_count":5579},{"name":"BrandonOldenburg","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"美国动画","count":3,"total_count":2281},{"name":"动画电影","count":3,"total_count":43928},{"name":"剧场版","count":2,"total_count":726189},{"name":"童年","count":1,"total_count":93208},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_count":433},{"name":"短片&OVA","count":1,"total_count":138},{"name":"映画","count":1,"total_count":6311},{"name":"书","count":1,"total_count":31},{"name":"AM","count":1,"total_count":285},{"name":"WilliamJoyce","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"温馨","count":1,"total_count":2205},{"name":"独立动画","count":1,"total_count":2498},{"name":"TV","count":1,"total_count":1408089},{"name":"其它","count":1,"total_count":917},{"name":"平静","count":1,"total_count":286},{"name":"US","count":1,"to